#: mvp_charts/templates/cotton/echarts/region.html:45
msgid ""
"No charting library to draw with. Load ECharts from your own base template, "
"or expose it as window.echarts from your bundle."
msgstr ""
"No charting library to draw with. Load ECharts from your own base template, "
"or expose it as window.echarts from your bundle."

#: mvp_charts/templates/cotton/echarts/region.html:46
msgid ""
"No height to fill. Give the element around this chart a height: a chart "
"region takes its size from its wrapper and has none of its own."
msgstr ""
"No height to fill. Give the element around this chart a height: a chart "
"region takes its size from its wrapper and has none of its own."
